ime by looting its valuable resources for weapons, medical supplies, ammo, blueprints and more. Sell looted items at the shops or use them on yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["314 Arts"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/763310/header.jpg?t=1774365667","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 2019-2023, 314 Arts. All rights reserved. Published by Maximum Entertainment\u2122. Maximum Entertainment\u2122 is a registered trademark of Maximum Entertainment, LLC. All rights reserved. All other trademarks or registered trademarks belong to their respective owners.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> TBA<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> TBA<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> TBA MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> TBA<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> TBA MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> TBA<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> TBA</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> TBA<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> TBA<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> TBA MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> TBA<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> TBA MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> TBA</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/763310/406036412/d5a8003a889312bb3da3c875740d5071a44a1d7e/1758756728/dash_av1.mpd?t=1759258842","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/763310/406036